{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39910","headline":"司直巡官无诸移到玫瑰花 · 徐夤","name":"司直巡官无诸移到玫瑰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳菲移自越王台，最似蔷薇好并栽。\n穠艳尽怜胜彩绘，嘉名谁赠作玫瑰。\n春藏锦绣风吹拆，天染琼瑶日照开。\n爲报朱衣早邀客，莫教零落委苍苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}